  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>Enormous, cheerful, and holding a greataxe that is bigger than the rules allow. It is not angry. It has never been angry. It was just strong.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
